        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sweet gas, burned in gas turbine, production</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sweet gas, burned in gas turbine, production
Most emissions based on data for NO others based on assumptions.;
5f3b8f7e-ce26-35d4-8860-75c9e3d2016b
Emissions of (sweet) gas burned in gas turbine. Excluded are SO2-, Nox- and CH4-emissions. They need to be assessed separately
Location:  Global average.
Technology: Burning of natural gas in gas turbine.
Time period: Time of estimation.
Production volume: Burned on extraction sites (sweet+sour) about 9930 bcm of natural gas in 2019
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: From country data to global situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5f3b8f7e-ce26-35d4-8860-75c9e3d2016b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
